// Title: Rundll32 UNC Path Execution
// Rule ID: 5cdb711b-5740-4fb2-ba88-f7945027afac
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.execution, attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1021.002, attack.t1218.011
// Category: process_creation
